WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.280
Another thing Dr. Bright is not&nbsp;
allowed to do at the Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:07.420
Dr. Bright! SCP-173 doesn't just want a hug!

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:12.940
SCP-173 is one of the deadliest anomalies&nbsp;
contained at the SCP Foundation. It waits&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:16.660
for someone to break eye contact with it,&nbsp;
and then rewards them by snapping their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:21.340
neck. There is no reason to believe that this&nbsp;
entity is responding to a lack of affection,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:25.120
and attempting to hug it is&nbsp;
likely to end in tragedy.

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:29.380
So Dr. Bright, stop telling new&nbsp;
recruits that "he just needs a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:32.080
hug!" Their blood is on your hands if they listen.

